##### 20.2. Determination of Characteristic Values

A solution of **20.1.1** with \(v\) replaced by \(z\), havir period \(\pi\) or \(2\pi\) is of the form

\[y{=}\sum\limits_{m=0}^{\infty}\,\left(A_{m}\cos\,mz{+}B_{n}\sin\,mz\right)\]

where \(B_{0}\) can be taken as zero. If the above substituted into **20.1.1** one obtains

\[\begin{array}{l}20.2.2\\ \sum\limits_{m=-1}^{\infty}\,\left[(a{-}m^{2})A_{m}{-}q(A_{m-2}{+}A_{m+2})\right] \,\cos\,mz\\ {+}\sum\limits_{m=-1}^{\infty}\,\left[(a{-}m^{2})B_{m}{-}q(B_{m-2}{+}B_{m+2}) \right]\,\sin\,mz{=}0\\ A_{m},B_{n}{=}0\qquad m{>}0\end{array}\]